w-full flex-col gap-[57px] lg:max-w-[498px]"><article class="relative overflow-clip rounded-md bg-page before:absolute before:inset-0 before:bg-ash/40 flex h-[150px] w-full gap-6 p-4"><div class="relative flex h-[118px] w-[205.08px] shrink-0 flex-col justify-between"><h3 class="text-title-24 text-white">Security</h3><p class="text-body-14 leading-[1.32] text-white/80">SOC 2 Type II compliant. Security reports available on request.</p></div><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" width="490" height="268" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="pointer-events-none absolute top-4 left-[237.33px] h-[134px] w-[244.95px] max-w-none select-none" style="color:transparent" sizes="100vw" srcSet="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=640&amp;q=90 640w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=750&amp;q=90 750w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=828&amp;q=90 828w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=1080&amp;q=90 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=1200&amp;q=90 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=1920&amp;q=90 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=2048&amp;q=90 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=90 3840w" src="/_next/image?url=%2F_next%2Fstatic%2Fimmutable%2Fmedia%2Fsecurity-art.2go0dn0ngsx4r.webp&amp;w=3840&amp;q=90"/><canvas aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute top-4 left-[237.33px] h-[134px] w-[244.95px] max-w-none"></canvas></article><div class="flex max-w-[331.31px] flex-col items-start gap-8"><p class="text-body-16 text-white/80">Give your agents room to work. Keep control as you scale.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><a data-slot="button" data-variant="unstyled" data-size="none" class="font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive inline-flex h-8 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm p-2.5 font-sans normal-case text-button-14 whitespace-nowrap hover:opacity-90 bg-white text-carbon" href="/security">Explore security<svg viewBox="0 0 11.2365 7.06066" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="size-[unset] -m-[0.53033px] h-[7.06066px] w-[11.2365px] shrink-0"><path d="M0 3.53033H10.1758M7.17581 6.53033L10.1758 3.53033L7.17581 0.53033" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"></path></svg></a><a data-slot="button" data-variant="unstyled" data-size="none" class="font-medium disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive inline-flex h-8 shrink-0 cursor-pointer items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-sm p-2.5 font-sans normal-case text-button-14 whitespace-nowrap hover:opacity-90 bg-white/8 text-white/64" href="/enterprise">Building at scale?</a></div></div></div><article class="relative overflow-clip rounded-md bg-page before:absolute before:inset-0 before:bg-ash/40 flex h-[265px] w-full flex-col justify-between p-4 lg:max-w-[306px]"><h3 class="relative text-title-24 text-white">Permissions</h3><img alt="" loading="lazy" width="612" height="383" decoding="asy